{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の夜中のまなったん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らじらー！出演後、お家に帰り\n乃木中・MJ・欅ちゃんのテレビを\n交互に見終えた後..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ん？そういえば明日\n雪降るとかいってたような...」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーカーテンを開くー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「きゃーーーーっ！\nもう降ってるじゃんっ！\nわーーーーい！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー深夜2時前に窓を開け、ベランダへー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「(ちっちゃい声で)うわ！\nやばっ♡雪だ～∩^ω^∩」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー手届くかな？ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー手を伸ばしてみるー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「届いた～♡」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーもっと手に積もらせたり\nできないかな？ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー5分ほど手を出したまま待ってみるー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「くしゅんっっ！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「えっ！さむ！！\n(てかこんな時間に\nなにしてんだろ。\nしかもくしゃみするまで\n気づかなかった)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー霜焼けになりかけの\n手を拭いながらお部屋に\n戻りました。笑ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じで深夜に1人で\nはしゃいでたら\nちょっぴり寝不足です...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完全に自業自得( ´･ᴗ･` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして朝起きてみたら結構積もってて\nお仕事行く時すってんころりんしそうに\nなりましたヾ(｡><)ｼ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って朝書いてたら、そのあと\nお仕事終わりに歩いていたら\n思いっきり転びました...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稀に見る完璧な\nすってんころりんでした(-ω-；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何事も油断は禁物です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも冬を満喫できた気がして\n幸せでした～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/01/18/2919474/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！冒頭にも書きましたが\n昨日はらじらー！に呼んで頂きました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリラジの中田さん、藤森さん\nそしてひめたん♪スタッフの皆様\nありがとうございました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく楽しくてあっという間でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なめ福神を脱することは出来ましたが\nまた何度でもひめたんと勝負を\nさせてもらいたいなと思ってます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またひめたんともご飯行くんだ♪\nいつでも誘ってくださいな(。-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいま発売中の\nananオフショット～∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/01/18/2919474/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"枕投げの標的にされてるのに\n喜ぶ私ヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういうの好きなんです...♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとにこんな感じで\nメンバーと合宿したら\n楽しいんだろうなぁ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごはんも自分たちで作って\nお布団も自分たちで敷く。"},{"type":"break"},{"type